2026-10-12 22:03:00 - __main__ - INFO - Chunk 20: - 1.29 In "dog-friendly zones" (if any) or places that dogs may come into contact with, no plants poisonous to dogs should be placed. Reference should be made to the list of common plants harmful to dogs on the webpage of the AFCD.
