2026-10-12 22:03:00 - __main__ - INFO - Chunk 21: - 1.33 A restaurant operator should reasonably limit the number of tables and chairs of the restaurant and consider maintaining appropriate seating spacing for dogs to lie down or rest safely, while ensuring that customers and staff have sufficient space to move around, and lowering the risk of stepping on dogs accidentally.
