2026-10-12 22:03:24 - __main__ - INFO - Chunk 10: - 1.16 The frequency of cleaning and disinfection of tabletops and frequently touched surfaces (such as chair backs, table edges and door handles), especially in dog-friendly zones (if any) and after peak hours or periods of high customer flow, should be increased to maintain cleanliness.
